<view class="page"
  ><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner"
    >本地演练 · 不会向真实朋友发出邀请</view
  ><view class="eyebrow">安排一顿，让大家期待的饭</view
  ><view class="title">今天我掌勺</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note">{{error}}</view
  ><block wx:elif="{{!loading}}"
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="form-row"
        ><text>预计用餐人数</text
        ><input
          class="number-input"
          type="number"
          maxlength="2"
          value="{{estimatedPeople}}"
          data-field="estimatedPeople"
          bindinput="input" /></view
      ><view class="label">这一顿的名字</view
      ><input
        class="input"
        maxlength="40"
        value="{{title}}"
        data-field="title"
        bindinput="input" /><view class="form-row"
        ><text>用餐日期（北京时间）</text
        ><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="date"
          >{{date}} ›</picker
        ></view
      ><view class="form-row"
        ><text>用餐时间</text
        ><picker mode="time" value="{{time}}" bindchange="time"
          >{{time}} ›</picker
        ></view
      ><view class="form-row"
        ><text>提前几分钟截止点菜</text
        ><input
          class="number-input"
          type="number"
          maxlength="4"
          value="{{cutoffMinutes}}"
          data-field="cutoffMinutes"
          bindinput="input" /></view
    ></view>
    <view wx:if="{{draftSaved}}" class="muted">未发布的安排已暂存，退出后可以继续。</view>
    <view class="section-title">这次可以点什么 · {{selected.length}}道</view
    ><checkbox-group bindchange="select"
      ><label class="card compact row" wx:for="{{dishes}}" wx:key="id"
        ><view
          ><view>{{item.name}}</view
          ><view class="muted"
            >{{item.category_name}} · {{item.minutes}}分钟</view
          ></view
        ><checkbox
          value="{{item.id}}"
          checked="{{item.selected}}"
          color="#244B3B" /></label
    ></checkbox-group>
    <view wx:if="{{!dishes.length}}" class="empty"
      >先回厨房添加几道拿手菜。</view
    ><view class="muted"
      >你将成为本餐接单厨师。朋友提交的是想吃需求，最终制作份数由你确认。</view
    ><button
      class="primary"
      loading="{{busy}}"
      disabled="{{busy||!selected.length}}"
      bindtap="publish"
    >
      发布本次菜单
    </button></block
  ></view
>
